# Apps you add on top of the dotfiles. ONE list, used by every machine:
#   Arch / CachyOS : install.sh installs the "arch" column with pacman (install and every update)
#   NixOS          : nixos/le-dwm.nix adds the "nix" column to the system (applied by nixos-rebuild)
#
# columns:  name   arch-package   nixpkgs-attribute        ("-" = not needed on that system)
# add one with:   le-pkg add <name> [arch-package] [nix-attribute]
#
# name        arch          nix
# vlc         vlc           vlc
# obsidian    obsidian      obsidian
# btop        btop          btop
